<title>UK: European precious metals close narrowly mixed.</title>
<headline>European precious metals close narrowly mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $338.00/$338.50 unchanged. Very narrow range all day supported by physical interest. Off high after dollar held dip triggered by easier data.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended up a cent at $4.78/$4.80.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Closed $7.00 firmer at $418.50/$423.50 day's high regaining Monday levels. Still nervous and choppy.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finished up $1.50 at $196.50/$201.50.</p>
</text>
